# ── Dart / Flutter build artifacts (any subdir: app/, grid_app/, …) ──
**/.dart_tool/
**/build/
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/.packages
**/.pub-cache/
**/generated_plugin_registrant.dart
**/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.*

# ── Android / Gradle ──
**/.gradle/
**/local.properties
# release keystore/key.properties 有意纳入 git 随仓库备份(远端为 GitHub 私有仓库,保持 Private);
# 若仓库转公开,必须先把它们移出 git 历史并换签名 keystore(见 grid_app/BUILD_NOTES.md)。

# ── iOS / macOS ──
**/Pods/
.DS_Store

# ── IDE ──
.idea/
**/*.iml
.vscode/

# ── Superpowers scratch: SDD ledger/briefs/review packages + brainstorm mockups ──
.superpowers/
